# ── The credential ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ntfy topic: anyone who knows it can read your notifications and post to
# them. It lives only in ~/.config/ntfy-notify.conf, never in git.
ntfy-notify.conf
config/ntfy-notify.conf
!config/ntfy-notify.conf.example

# ── Runtime state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Counters, cursors, dedup history, health verdicts, heartbeats. Machine
# local by nature — recreating them is harmless, committing them is noise.
state/
*.state
*.cursor

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# ── Logs / scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
